---
source: crates/aldente-cli/tests/crater.rs
expression: "env.text(&[\"crater\", \"shop.pricing/price\", \"--direction\", \"reverse\",\n\"--min-certainty\", \"possible\"])"
---
reverse crater of clj:.//shop.pricing/price   depth 6   min possible   5 nodes
certain (5)
  unit:.
    shop.core
      -main  src/shop/core.clj:21:1  2 via clj:.//shop.core/checkout
      checkout  src/shop/core.clj:12:1  1 via clj:.//shop.pricing/price
    shop.pricing
      price  src/shop/pricing.clj:5:1  seed
    shop.pricing-test
      book-is-half-off  test/shop/pricing_test.clj:8:1  1 via clj:.//shop.pricing/price
      food-is-taxed  test/shop/pricing_test.clj:5:1  1 via clj:.//shop.pricing/price
